Package: mosquitto
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Felix Becker <felix+git@becker.koeln>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: adduser (>= 3.10)
Suggests: apparmor
Provides: mosquitto-clients
Conflicts: mosquitto-clients
Replaces: mosquitto-clients
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://mosquitto.org/
Description: MQTT version 5.0/3.1.1/3.1 compatible message broker (static build)
 Statically linked build of Eclipse Mosquitto including the broker, the
 command line clients (mosquitto_pub, mosquitto_sub, mosquitto_rr) and the
 tools mosquitto_passwd, mosquitto_ctrl, mosquitto_signal and
 mosquitto_db_dump. It has no shared library dependencies.
 .
 Filesystem layout, configuration and service setup follow the Debian
 mosquitto package.
